 "about_item": "Second-Skin Soft & Invisible Breathable - Measuring the waist and hips is highly recommended for the best fit. If you are in between sizes or you prefer a looser fit, please order one size up. SHAPELLX shapewear will initially seem small but 4-way stretch easily, Beauty is not without its pain. Choose this shapewear tummy control womens for seamless compression, comfortable tummy control, and a waist-slimming effect.   Comfortable & Supportive - The tummy control bodysuit use special seamless designs around the middle and waist part, bring more compression than other bodysuit. It fits tightly to your body, wraps the waist & abdomen & back with its compression, tighten your tummy and back, which make your curve more slim, give you a beautiful hourglass figure.   Thigh Slimmer & Seamless Compression - This shapewear bodysuit stays in place well throughout the day. that the legs don't roll up and the bodysuit remains stable, even for extended wear. It is Invisible underneath your dress, smoothing out lumps, and slimmers the thigh, creating a slimmer feminine silhouette.   Butt Lift & Easy Bathroom Access - The breast and the bottom area of this seamless full body suit are made from breathable 3D mesh material for all-day wear, effectively lifting your hips and bread, giving you a curvy butt and a perfect hourglass figure. We\u2019ve prioritized your convenience with an open crotch design for easy bathroom access\u2014no need to undress completely.   Versatile Lifestyle Wear from Office to Party - From Airport Outfits to Date Night elegance, this tummy control shapewear is your go-to wardrobe essential. Its invisible, seamless design perfectly under wedding gowns, formal dresses, date night outfits, or everyday work dresses. A thoughtful and perfect gift for women who value confidence and style. Pairs perfectly with coats, trousers, skirts, jeans and boots.",
